{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/689247-at-what-point-can-i-write-mortal-authoritys-off-as-irrelevant","id":689247,"title":"AT what point Can I Write mortal authoritys off as Irrelevant?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-04T21:06:00-07:00","id":689247,"title":"AT what point Can I Write mortal authoritys off as Irrelevant?","content":"Was curious what powers should I aim for to be able to to consider the authoritys &quot;Irrelevant&quot; as far as any disruptions my actions cause...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T22:06:29-07:00","id":689299,"title":"","content":"It really depends on what you buy. A handful of social knacks can walk you into pretty much any place you want, no matter how guarded. And you can do that right off the bat. You can buy Boys Will Be Boys and pretty much walk from anything with nothing more than a wrist slap. Social knacks can be really devestating if you use them cleverly. Probably the reason that the game doesn't have a Resources rating. When you can walk up to any super duper rich person, bust a few social knacks and have them willing to bank roll you there's really no need. And the same is true of federal agents, chiefs of police, mayors and such, who will bury the repercussions of your actions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2608-squee","name":"Squee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2608_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-04T22:18:27-07:00","id":689308,"title":"","content":"Admittingly, Unless were relying on a bit of ST fiat or extremely irresponsible and dangerous public antics from a PC. Virtually from chargen, Mortal authorities prove utterly impotent against a scion beyond a minor inconvenience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3835-\u00falfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","name":"\u00dalfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T07:28:14-07:00","id":689674,"title":"","content":"oh Curious, In Japan or someplace else with strict gun control, will &quot;Boys will be boys&quot; Prevent confiscation, or just arrest?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T09:14:43-07:00","id":689779,"title":"","content":"The Japanese authorities wouldn't bat an eye at a guy decked out for a spree shooting if he used Boys Will Be Boys on them. They won't arrest him or confiscate his weapon. His transgression is A-OK as far they are concerned. However, a lot of people will be screaming and running away or hiding as he walked around, though and, he will keep encountering new potential victims he needs to obviate. Unless he is willing to burn through a lot of Legend, he might have to adopt alternative tactics. (Let the peasants run away always works.) His movements wouldn't be exactly quiet or unnoticed. All the CCTV cameras will show him walking around with all that hardware, and it will show that, whenever the police confront him, he starts talking and they back off. Someone he didn't mind-whammy might get the idea that he is more of a problem than just a gun-toting maniac and start deploying more effective means of containment. Like snipers and a guy with a loudspeaker to tell him to stand down (or, if he has publicly used those guns, just the snipers), the Japanese equivalent of SWAT with earbuds under noise canceling headphones, etc. Considering the potential for a Japanese Scion to see the government as being divinely backed, there might even be someone they can call when these sort of things happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T10:15:37-07:00","id":689858,"title":"","content":"Ajax's events are largely what i meant about &quot;Irresponsible actions&quot; that might make mortals an inconvenience, and if your in some nations, deadly. Any person who gets within earshot of a scion is done, whether its because they are killed or they get talked down, but someone on the other side of the country could send in drones or bombers or snipers and seriously ruin your day. If a government is aware of what you can do, then it becomes a matter of special tactics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3835-\u00falfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","name":"\u00dalfh\u00e9\u00f0nar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T13:22:53-07:00","id":690204,"title":"","content":"I'd say when you can flip a semi truck over your shoulder like a pancake, the authorities become pretty irrelevant. And then there are those who can actually lift buildings. Remember, you're playing someone who's on the path towards godhood, you're power isn't even comparable to mortals.<br /> <br /> <br /> You don't just have to rely on Social Knacks, either. You can strong arm the authorities.<br /> <br /> <br /> Armor Crusher - You can actually pierce through body armor with your blows. So when they do send in the special forces, they might as well be naked.<br /> <br /> Holy Bound - Run down a dead end and leap up the wall while the police are stuck in the alleyway. If you get Divine Bound, you can just Hulk Jump your way out of the city.<br /> <br /> Holy Rampage - You can easily break restraints, making the concept of arresting you kind of a moot point.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-05-2015, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-06T12:35:44-07:00","id":691589,"title":"","content":"In the newer edition, it'll be harder to consider mortal authorities completely irrelevant (though they pretty much are) and even gods can't exactly <i>ignore </i>the World.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}